| **Tarot v3 / ML Registry v3** | Current and future registry API |
| **MSP** | Model Serving Platform — registration + deployment |
| **MSP SDK** | Python SDK (`atlassian-msp-sdk`) for packaging/upload/registration |
| **Namespace** | Hierarchical folder for organizing components |
| **Component** | A registered ML entity (model, prompt, dataset, etc.) |
| **Component Type** | `model`, `sagemaker-package`, `prompt`, `dataset`, etc. |
| **Version** | Immutable snapshot of artifacts under a component |
| **Artifact** | Individual file with hash, filename, metadata |
| **Dreamcatcher** | Lineage graph service |
| **Deployment Store** | Regional artifact replication service |
| **Launchpad** | Pre-production testing sandbox (ephemeral SageMaker endpoints) |
| **TEAMServe** | GPU-aware Triton-based model serving platform |
| **DMP** | Deployment Metadata Platform (compliance gating) |
| **PRGB** | Peer Review, Green Build (compliance control) |
| **ML Studio** | Databricks-based workflow orchestration platform |
| **Released Workflow** | Production-grade, PRGB-compliant ML Studio workflow |

