## 6. Model Performance Metrics

ML Lens supports model performance metrics as custom emissions. Common patterns:

| Domain | Example namespace.key | Tags |
|--------|----------------------|------|
| Reranking | `kyc.reranking.NDCG@1` | use_case, model_id |
| Feature drift | `contextual_bandits.ml_observability.feature_drift.psi_score` | model_group, use_case, metric_date |
| Model evaluation | `search_relevance.model_validation_new.mrr` | ml_studio_run_id |
| Data quality | `mlfs.ers_writes.error_count_total` | env, feature_view, source |

**Model Performance Metric Families**:
- NDCG@K, MAP@K, MRR, Hit Rate@K, Precision@K, Recall@K
- F1, AUC, accuracy, precision, recall
- Custom: any numeric value emitted with proper namespace

**Source**: [ML Observability on ML Lens — Technical Design](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/KYC/pages/6533264972/ML+Observability+on+ML+Lens+Technical+Design), [Per-Placement Alerting](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~595679117/pages/6980636372/Per-Placement+Alerting+at+Scale+for+KYC+ML+Observability)

