## 5. Data Quality Metrics

### 5.1 Default Metrics (auto-computed by SDK by dtype)
- **Numeric**: mean, std_dev, min, max, uniqueness, null_count
- **String**: uniqueness, null_count
- **Date/Timestamp**: min, max, null_count

### 5.2 StarRocks SQL — Quality Query (Native ML Lens)
```sql
SELECTfeature_name,
  COUNT(*) AS total_count,
  COUNT(CASE WHEN value IS NULL THEN 1 END) AS null_count,
  ROUND(null_count * 100.0 / COUNT(*), 4) AS null_pct,
  COUNT(CASE WHEN value = 0 THEN 1 END) AS zero_count,
  AVG(value) AS mean_val,
  STDDEV_POP(value) AS stddev_val,
  MIN(value) AS min_val,
  MAX(value) AS max_val,
  PERCENTILE_APPROX(value, 0.25) AS p25,
  PERCENTILE_APPROX(value, 0.50) AS p50,
  PERCENTILE_APPROX(value, 0.75) AS p75,
  PERCENTILE_APPROX(value, 0.95) AS p95,
  PERCENTILE_APPROX(value, 0.99) AS p99,
  APPROX_COUNT_DISTINCT(value) AS approx_cardinality
FROM feature_logs
WHERE feature_name = ? AND ts >= ? AND ts < ?
GROUP BY feature_name;
```

### 5.3Emission to ML Lens
```python
ctx = Context(spark)
result = ctx.run_default_metrics_and_emit(
    df=df,
    table_name_for_key="catalog.schema.table",
    run_id="example-run-id",
    metric_namespace="ml_platform_data_profiling",
    tags={"env": "dev", "source": "example"},
)
```

**Source**: [ML Data Quality SDK](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/agd/pages/6192433232/ML+Data+Quality+SDK), [Option1: StarRocks as Compute Engine](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6949715806/Option+1+StarRocks+as+Compute+Engine+Deep+Drift+Analysis)

