## 9. Existing Workspace Tool Artifacts — Reuse vs. Gaps Analysis

### Available MCP Tools (from workspace)

| Tool | Capabilities | Reuse for Operate Cluster |
|------|-------------|---------------------------|
| **mcp__atlassian__** (Jira/Confluence) | Issue CRUD, CQL search, page operations | ✅ Incident ticket creation, PIR page creation, runbook retrieval |
| **mcp__bitbucket__** | PR operations, repo queries, pipelines | ✅ IaC PR creation for detectors/SLOs, code search for configs |
| **mcp__slack__** | Message search, channel history, threads | ✅ Incident channel monitoring, 30-min status cadence, alert routing |
| **mcp__compass__** | Service catalog, dependencies, ownership | ✅ Service tier lookup, affected service identification, owner routing |
| **mcp__switcheroo__** | Feature gate operations | ✅ Kill-switch toggling, fail-open control, canary gates |
| **mcp__teamwork_graph__** | Org hierarchy, work summaries, entity resolution | ✅ On-call identification, service ownership, escalation paths |

### Gap Analysis — What New Tools Must Encode

| New Tool | Why Existing Tools Don't Cover It |
|----------|-----------------------------------|
| **ml_lens_queries** | ML Lens has a proprietary API (metric store, drift configs, alert evaluation) not exposed through any existing MCP tool |
| **signalfx_detector_iac** | Requires SignalFlow program generation + Terraform HCL synthesis + Sauron pipeline knowledge — not in any existing tool |
| **circuit_breaker_control** | CB state read/write requires direct service introspection (actuator endpoints, Resilience4j metrics) + Switcheroo gates |
| **incident_pir_drafter** | Requires cross-tool orchestration (Slack timeline + JSM data + template synthesis) with PIR-specific domain logic |
| **ml_launch_review_gate** | Deployment manifest validation is a new concept requiring evidence collection across multiple systems |
| **symphony_orbit_enrichment** | ORBIT context packs are a new abstraction layer over TWG — no existing tool packages context this way |

### Reuse Strategy

**For each new tool, leverage existing MCP tools as building blocks:**
- `incident_pir_drafter` → Uses `mcp__slack__` (timeline), `mcp__atlassian__` (create PIR page), JSM API (incident data)
- `signalfx_detector_iac` → Uses `mcp__bitbucket__` (create PR with Terraform changes)
- `circuit_breaker_control` → Uses `mcp__switcheroo__` (kill-switch toggling) + direct HTTP for CB state
- `ml_launch_review_gate` → Uses `mcp__compass__` (service tier), `mcp__atlassian__` (evidence docs), `mcp__bitbucket__` (deployment artifacts)
- `symphony_orbit_enrichment` → Uses `mcp__teamwork_graph__` (base context), adds ML-scored personalization layer

