## 8. Key Terminology & Taxonomy for AI Understanding

| Term | Definition | System |
|------|-----------|--------|
| Feature View (FV) | A definition of how a feature is computed from raw data | Tecton/MLFS DSL |
| Feature Service (FS) | A named group of feature views exposed as a serving API | Tecton/MLFS |
| Batch Feature View (BFV) | FV computed on a schedule from batch data | Both |
| Stream Feature View (SFV) | FV computed in near-real-time from streaming data (Kinesis/Kafka) | Both |
| Feature Table | Pre-computed features loaded directly (no transformation) | Both |
| Materialization | The process of computing and writing features to online/offline stores | Both |
| Point-in-Time Join | Retrieving feature values as they existed at the time of each training observation | Both |
| ERS | Entity Resolution Service — MLFS's online key-value store | MLFS |
| ML Lens | Atlassian's ML observability platform for drift detection and feature monitoring | Internal |
| Tarot | Atlassian's ML model registry | Internal |
| ML Studio | Atlassian's ML development environment (Databricks-based) | Internal |
| CCE | Core Compute Engine — Databricks pipeline orchestration | Internal |
| Socrates | Atlassian's data warehouse (Databricks workspace) | Internal |

---

## 9. Critical Integration Points

1. **Feature DQ → Slack Alerting**: Pipeline results should notify via configurable Slack channels
2. **Feature DQ → JIRA Ticket Creation**: FAILURE status can auto-create Jira issues (pattern from Commerce DQ framework)
3. **MLFS Registry → Unified Feature Catalog**: Metadata syncs every 6 hours via CCE job
4. **ML Lens → Feature Observability**: Drift metrics computed every 5 minutes for registered features
5. **Tecton `materialization_status()`**: Used for freshness checks without scanning data (Stage 1)
6. **Delta Lake `mode("append") + mergeSchema=true`**: Both DQ tables use append-mode Delta format

---

## 10. Common Failure Modes & Remediation Patterns

| Failure Mode | Detection | Remediation |
|-------------|-----------|-------------|
| Feature View 100% null for >7 days | Sparsity check | Tag as `deprecation_candidate`, notify owner |
| Freshness SLA breach (>24h stale) | Freshness check | Check materialization job status, trigger manual run |
| Volume drop >20% DoD | Volume check | Investigate upstream source (outage? schema change?) |
| Coverage anomaly by region | Coverage check per region | Check tenant migration events, AZ rotation |
| Train-serve skew >5% mean deviation | ML Lens comparison | Compare transformation logic between online/offline paths |
| Schema drift (new categories) | Cardinality check | Update feature registry YAML, validate downstream models |[0m
