## 4. Incident Communication Cadence

### 4.1 Standard Communication Cadence

From [Incident Response Training - Module 2](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~680921421/pages/6813995679) and [Incident Management Runbook](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CL1/pages/6205531023):

| Severity | Internal Update Cadence | External (Status Page) Cadence | First External Comms |
|----------|------------------------|-------------------------------|---------------------|
| Sev0/Sev1 | Every 15 min (even "no change") | Every 30 min | Within 20 min of HOT |
| Sev2| Every 15–30 min | Every 30–60 min | Within 20 min of HOT |
| Sev3 | Every 30–60 min | As required | N/A (usually internal only) |

### 4.2 Communication Template Structure

From [Incident Response Training - Module 2](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~680921421/pages/6813995679):

**Initial declaration (within 5 min):**
```
🚨 P[X] declared. [One sentence description]. IC: [Name]. Bridge: [link]. Status page: updated/updating.
```

**Regular updates:**
```
[Timestamp] [Status: Investigating/Identified/Monitoring/Resolved]
- Current impact: [what users are experiencing]
- Mitigation progress: [what we're doing]
- Next steps: [planned actions]
```

**Resolution:**
```
✅ Resolved. [Root cause summary]. Total duration: [X min]. PIR to follow.
```

### 4.3 Status Page Stages

| Stage | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| **Investigating** | Issue being assessed |
| **Identified** | Cause or likely cause identified |
| **Monitoring** | Fix applied, recovery being observed |
| **Resolved** | Customer impact ended |

### 4.4 How This Applies to ml-incident-response SKILL.md

- The AI agent must enforce **30-min status cadence** by posting timed updates to the incident Slack thread
- Updates must include: current impact, mitigation progress, next steps
- For ML-specific incidents, updates should include: current error rate, drift score delta, circuit-breaker state, model rollback status
- The AI should surface "silence detected" warnings if no update has been posted for > cadence window
- Human confirmation required (🟡 tier) before posting external communications

