# ML Launch Review Checklist — Automated Gate Mapping for `ml_launch_review_gate`

## 1. The Canonical ML Launch Review Checklist (Atlassian Internal)

### Source & Structure
The canonical checklist is defined in the **[ML Launch Review Proposal](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DTIE/pages/3611920350/ML+Launch+Review+Proposal)** and its **[Template](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DTIE/pages/4818634684)**. It defines two review phases:

**Phase 1: Pre-Experiment Launch Review**
**Phase 2: Pre-Production Launch Review**

The checklist explicitly tracks **"Current Status — Status and automation requirements"** per item, indicating the team anticipated automation of each gate.

### Complete Gate Inventory (Pre-Production — the launch gate)

| # | Gate Category | Checklist Item | Priority | Owner |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| G1 | Privacy & Compliance | Privacy and security review | Must Have | PM |
| G2 | Privacy & Compliance | Model fairness/inclusive/compliance review | Optional | PM |
| G3 | Model Development | Model auto-retraining pipeline | Must Have | MLE |
| G4 | Model Deployment | Model roll-back plan | Must Have | MLE |
