## 7. Launchpad Pre-Production Validation

### 7.1 What is Launchpad

**What it is**: Atlassian's pre-production model validation environment. MLEs can deploy ephemeral endpoints on TEAMServe dev infrastructure to test model packages before production.

**Validation stages**:
1. **Stage 1: Launchpad Testing** — Quick latency validation from Databricks notebooks (minutes)
2. **Stage 2: Local Profiling** — Deep optimization (optional, if Stage 1 reveals issues)
3. **Stage 3: Load Testing** — Validate under realistic production load
4. **Stage 4: Shadow Testing** — Compare against production baseline
5. **Stage 5: Canary Rollout** — Gradual production traffic

**ML Studio automated validation modules**:
- `ts_lp_launch_validation`: Launches model on LaunchPad, verifies InService status, sends golden request, records annotation in ML Registry
- `ts_lp_loadtest_validation`: Runs benchmark load test, records annotation

**Source**: [Latency Validation Framework for Model Deployment](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120204aa07fe7450f489899b60900ad6a0967/pages/5981244955), [RFC: Launchpad Upgraded](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AO2/pages/5852226559), [Design Doc: ts_lp_launch_validation](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120203e8fad871e7f452c8bec69de58960c46/pages/6962155706)

### 7.2 Pre-Deployment Checklist for ML Models

From ML Platform docs:

| Check | Prevents | How |
|-------|----------|-----|
| Package exists in registry | Missing artifacts | ML Registry lookup |
| Package loads correctly | Buggy model crashes | Launchpad launch test |
| Model input/output matches spec | API contract violations | Golden payload test |
| Model compatible with container | Runtime errors | Launchpad container test |
| Model compatible with instance | OOM/disk errors | Launchpad instance test |
| Latency within KR | SLO violations | Load test |
| No memory leaks | Gradual degradation | Extended soak test |

**Source**: [Pre-Deployment Checklist, Towards Faster Onboarding](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6186363172), [How To: Deploy ML Models to TEAMServe](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120204aa07fe7450f489899b60900ad6a0967/pages/5959589965)

