**Deployment Manifest Schema (from role doc §10.5):**
```yaml
deployment_manifest:
  intent: "What this deployment aims to achieve"
  non_goals: "What is explicitly out of scope"
  invariants: "Properties that must remain true"
  risk_assessment:
    blast_radius: "Number of affected tenants/services"
    rollback_time: "Expected time to rollback"
    data_risk: "Whether persistent data is modified"
  rollback_plan:
    mechanism: "canary | feature_gate | revert_deploy"
    gate_name: "switcheroo gate name if applicable"
    estimated_time: "time to full rollback"
  autonomy_tier: "green | yellow | red"
