## 7. Autonomy Tiering & Deployment Manifest (§10.5)

### 3-Tier Autonomy Model
| Tier | Symbol | Meaning | AI Action | Human Role |
|------|--------|---------|-----------|------------|
| **Tier 1** | 🟢 | Autonomous | Executes without approval | Reviews outcomes, not process |
| **Tier 2** | 🟡 | Confirm | Proposes action, waits for approval | Approves/rejects before execution |
| **Tier 3** | 🔴 | Human Required | Cannot execute; surfaces information | Makes the decision and acts |

### Maturity Levels (L1–L5)
| Level | Name | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| L1 | Ad hoc | Inconsistent execution; unclear ownership; reactive |
| L2 | Defined | Roles documented; basic rhythms exist |
| L3 | Operational | Consistent execution; standard workflows; metrics collected |
| L4 | Managed/Measured | Reliable traceability; KPIs drive prioritization; audit-ready |
| L5 | Optimized/Intelligent | Proactive monitoring; automation reduces toil; continuous improvement |

### Deployment Manifest Schema
```yaml
deployment_manifest:
  intent: "What this change aims to achieve"
  non_goals: "What is explicitly NOT being changed"
  invariants:
    - "Property that must hold before and after"
    - "Example: fail-open rate ≤ 0.5%"
  risk:
    level: "LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH"
    blast_radius: "Description of impact scope"
    classification: "Routine | Feature | High-Risk | Infra"
  rollback:
    mechanism: "Feature gate toggle | Deployment revert | Manual intervention"
    time_estimate: "< 5 minutes"steps:
      - "Step 1: Disable feature gate X"
      - "Step 2: Verify metric Y returns to baseline"
  autonomy_tier: "🟢 | 🟡 | 🔴"
  approval_required: true | false
```

### Application to All 6 Tools
| Tool | 🟢 Operations | 🟡 Operations | 🔴 Operations |
|------|--------------|--------------|--------------|
| `ml_lens_queries` | Query metrics, drift scores | Modify alert thresholds | — |
| `signalfx_detector_iac` | Read detectors, generate HCL | Open PRs with detectors | Apply without review |
| `circuit_breaker_control` | Read state/metrics | Toggle kill-switch | Force state, modify thresholds |
| `incident_pir_drafter` | Collect data, generate draft | Publish PIR | Close incident |
| `ml_launch_review_gate` | Collect evidence, assess | Flag blockers | Go/No-Go decision |
| `symphony_orbit_enrichment` | Read/enrich context | Modify context structure | — |

**Source**: [Digital TPM: AI Employee Vision](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202027e1af5d30e94112880666ee62f9277a/pages/6900978790), [Agentic Operations in the New SDLC](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202027e1af5d30e94112880666ee62f9277a/pages/6885869718), [Governance - North Star FY27](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TRUSTORG/pages/6707958960)

