## Executive Summary

This report synthesizes findings for designing6 tools and 3 skills covering the operate-side reliability/observability/incident-response/governance cluster for an AI SRE employee role operating on the `responsible-ai-api` service. Research covers ML Lens drift detection, SignalFx detectors-as-code, circuit breaker management, JSM incident operations, ML launch governance, Symphony/ORBIT enrichment, and the3-tier autonomy model.

