## 12. Key Terminology & Taxonomies the AI Must Understand

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| HOT | Primary incident ticket in OpsJ/JSM |
| PIR | Post-Incident Review — structured review after incident |
| PIRX | Express PIR — lightweight variant for simple incidents |
| TTD | Time to Detect — incident start to first awareness |
| TTR | Time to Resolve — incident start to full resolution |
| TTC | Time to Communicate — incident creation to first notification |
| Error Budget | Allowable failure rate within SLO (e.g., 0.1% means 99.9% availability) |
| Fail-Open | Circuit breaker returns default/pass-through rather than blocking |
| Kill-Switch | Feature gate that can instantly disable a component |
| Sauron | Atlassian's IaC deployment service for SignalFx/Tome |
| Tome | Atlassian's SLO management platform |
| Observo | StarRocks-based metric store for ML Lens |
| SignalFlow | Query language for SignalFx detectors |
| PSI | Population Stability Index — drift metric |
| KS test | Kolmogorov-Smirnov test — distribution comparison |

