## 13. Human Confirmation Points (Critical for AI Employee Safety)

| Scenario | Why Human Required | Mechanism |
|----------|-------------------|-----------|
| Publish PIR | Accuracy, blamelessness review | 🟡 Draft generated, human approves |
| Modify CB thresholds | Could mask real outages | 🔴 Human decides |
| Go/No-Go for ML launch | Risk acceptance | 🔴 Human makes final call |
| Apply Terraform (detectors) | Production alerting impact | 🟡 PR review required |
| Escalate severity | Stakeholder impact, communication cascade | 🟡 Recommend but human confirms |
| Rollback deployment | Potential data loss, partial states | 🟡 Recommend with evidence, human approves |
| Close incident | Premature closure could miss issues | 🟡 Recommend based on metrics |

